0","body":["5,000㎡ 잔디 운동장, 여긴 '테마파크'네요 (애견동반)","원주 반려동물 테마파크 '파크드차밍' 내에 위치한 '차밍캠핑' 카라반 방문 후기입니다.","우리의 숙소, 카라반과 솔직한 아쉬움","입실 15:00","퇴실 11:00","게터웨이 189,000원 (※ 기준 가격, 변동 가능)","가능 (주차 공간 넓음)","반려견과 함께 갈만한 캠핑장을 찾다가 '차밍캠핑'이라는 이름을 발견했습니다.","알고 보니 이곳은 예전 레저파크 자리를 리모델링해서 만든 반려동물 테마파크 '파크드차밍' 이었고, '차밍캠핑'은 그 안에 있는 숙박 시설이었어요.","주차를 하고 건물 쪽으로 걸어가는데, 제 눈을 사로잡은 건 건물이 아니라 그 앞에 펼쳐진 잔디밭이었습니다."]}],"sns_images":[{"thumb":"https://search1.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/I3pmHA4QAr0","img":"https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dn/yzz9z/dJMcajURKoN/x6eOOYkDqesHs9katygG90/img.png","url":"https://pbjkrkr.tistory.com/954","src":"티스토리","w":1204,"h":804,"date":"2025-11-10"},{"thumb":"https://search2.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/8BR25oNoGDo","img":"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/48/2908648_image2_1.JPG","url":"https://leports.sailing-blog.click/927","src":"티스토리","w":940,"h":627,"date":"2025-11-11"},{"thumb":"https://search1.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/H16X6wI5tO4","img":"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/50/2908650_image2_1.JPG","url":"https://leports.sailing-blog.click/927","src":"티스토리","w":940,"h":625,"date":"2025-11-11"},{"thumb":"https://search3.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/9n7IIjVJDji","img":"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/52/2908652_image2_1.JPG","url":"https://leports.sailing-blog.click/927","src":"티스토리","w":940,"h":634,"date":"2025-11-11"},{"thumb":"https://search4.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/2kea8vcyi5D","img":"https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100208/6907Q1xSgWKJFj7t27RIN3pu.jpg","url":"https://blogsailing.com/5991","src":"티스토리","w":2000,"h":1333,"date":"2023-04-10"},{"thumb":"https://search3.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/JREqEh5ATZK","img":"https://gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100208/thumb/thumb_720_7948Cv6iPsUWliYzj2oDMbBG.jpg","url":"https://daylifehappy.tistory.com/1422","src":"티스토리","w":720,"h":448,"date":"2023-04-08"},{"thumb":"https://search4.kakaocdn.net/argon/130x130_85_c/WQFELiQ5IF","img":"https://tong.visitkorea.or.kr/cms/resource/